    <tags>cysense cybrium security cli rust cross-platform admin</tags>
    <summary>Traffic capture, protocol dissection and asset discovery</summary>
    <description>Passive network sensor for IT, OT and IoMT environments. Captures traffic, dissects protocols, and discovers assets without sending packets to the monitored network.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cysense).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cysense/releases/tag/v0.2.3</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
